## ScrubIpsApi

### Cancel a Scrub IP service and stop its recurring DDoS billing
## Cancel a Scrub IP service and stop its recurring DDoS billing
DELETE https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/scrub_ips/{{id}}
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Apply a predefined scrubbing filter (DNS/HTTP/synproxy) to a port
## Apply a predefined scrubbing filter (DNS/HTTP/synproxy) to a port
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/scrub_ips/{{id}}/create_filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "filter_type": "<string>",
 "port": "<number>"
}


### Add a geographic firewall rule (block/allow by country code or ASN)
## Add a geographic firewall rule (block/allow by country code or ASN)
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/scrub_ips/{{id}}/create_geo_rule
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "destination_port": "<number>",
 "country_code": "<number>",
 "asn": "<number>",
 "xdp_action": "<number>"
}


### Add an L3/L4 firewall rule (allow/drop by IP, port, and protocol)
## Add an L3/L4 firewall rule (allow/drop by IP, port, and protocol)
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/scrub_ips/{{id}}/create_rule
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "destination_port": "<number>",
 "source_ip": "<string>",
 "source_port": "<number>",
 "protocol_id": "<number>",
 "xdp_action": "<number>"
}


### Remove a scrubbing filter by matching filter_type and port
## Remove a scrubbing filter by matching filter_type and port
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/scrub_ips/{{id}}/delete_filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "filter_type": "<string>",
 "port": "<number>"
}


### Disable DDoS scrubbing and remove the BGP announcement on the IP
## Disable DDoS scrubbing and remove the BGP announcement on the IP
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/scrub_ips/{{id}}/disable
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Enable DDoS scrubbing (BGP announcement) on the service&#39;s protected IP
## Enable DDoS scrubbing (BGP announcement) on the service&#39;s protected IP
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/scrub_ips/{{id}}/enable
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

